&lt;p&gt;Here’s what the team will be looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Product management experience in data platforms, data infrastructure, or highly technical B2B environments.&lt;br&gt;👉 Strong technical fluency — comfortable discussing data modelling, orchestration (e.g. Airflow), transformation frameworks (e.g. dbt), APIs, and platform architecture trade-offs.&lt;br&gt;👉 Deep understanding of data quality, observability, governance, lineage, and compliance considerations (GDPR experience highly valued).&lt;br&gt;👉 Ability to define clear data contracts and scalable patterns rather than one-off solutions.&lt;br&gt;👉 Confident stakeholder management across engineering, research, operations, and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;👉 Experience owning or contributing to platform migrations or large-scale architectural evolution is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
