&lt;p&gt;InterSystems is willing to provide training in all the above areas, but you would already need to be proficient in MS Office, specifically Word and Excel, and have strong written and spoken English language skills.&amp;nbsp; You should have a strong understanding of LIMS functionality, interfaces, and configuration.&lt;br&gt;Domain Knowledge of laboratory workflows, with experience in specific areas like blood sciences, microbiology and Cell Pathology would be a significant asset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join a highly successful global software business and take your first step into an exciting career in technology.&lt;/p&gt;
